hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"151","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abu Sa'id Khudri apne walid Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain ke unhon ne kaha ke main peer ke din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Masjid-e-Quba ki taraf nikla. Jab ham Bani Salim ke mohallay mein pahunchay, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Utban bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ke darwazay par kharay ho kar us ko aawaz di to wo apni azaar ghaseettay hue niklay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ham ne us ko jaldi mein mubtala kar diya. Utban (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar koi shakhs jaldi apni aurat se alag ho jaye aur mani na niklay, to us ka kya hukm hai, yani ghusl karay ya nahi? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke pani ka istemal pani nikalnay se hai, yani mani nikalnay se ghusl wajib hota hai. (Muslim: 1/185). Baab: Mani se mani ka mansookh hona aur khatnon ke milnay se ghusl wajib hona."
"152","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Wujoob-e-ghusl ke is masalay mein Muhajireen aur Ansaar ki aik jamaat ne ikhtilaf kiya. Ansaar ne kaha ke ghusl jab hi wajib hota hai ke mani kood kar niklay aur inzaal ho, jabke Muhajireen ne kaha ke jab mard aurat se sohbat karay, to ghusl wajib hai. Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main tumhari tasalli kiye deta hun. Main utha aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke makaan par ja kar un se ijazat maangi. Unhon ne ijazat di, to main ne kaha ke Ae Ummul Momineen main Aap se kuch poochna chahta hun, lekin mujhe sharam aati hai. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke tu is baat ke poochnay mein mat sharam kar jo apni saghi maan se pooch sakta hai jis ne tujhe janam diya hai. Main bhi to teri maan hun, kyunke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyan momineen ki maayein hain. Main ne kaha ke ghusl kis se wajib hota hai? Unhon ne kaha ke tu ne achay waaqif kaar se poocha, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab mard aurat ke chaaron konon mein baithay aur khatna khatna se mil jaye, yani zakar farj mein daakhil ho jaye, to ghusl wajib ho gaya. (Muslim)"
"153","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne Umm Kulsoom (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat ki aur unhon ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se ke Aap ne kaha ke aik shakhs ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha ke agar koi mard apni aurat se jima karay, phir inzaal na kar sakay to kya donon par ghusl wajib hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main aur ye, yani Aisha (raziyallahu anha), aisa kartay hain, phir ghusl kartay hain. (Muslim: 1/187). (Aksala se murad inzaal se aajiz hona hai; ye riwayat Abu Zubair se hai aur Iyaz bin Abdullah se hai jin mein kalam hai; sahih ye hai ke ye Aisha par mauqoof hai.)"
"154","[AI-translation] Ishaq bin Abu Talha se riwayat hai ke Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Umm Sulaim (raziyallahu anha), aur wo rawi-e-hadees Ishaq bin Abu Talha ki daadi thin, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein aur wahan Aisha (raziyallahu anha) bhi baithi thin, unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aurat agar sotay mein aisa dekhay, jaisa ke mard dekhta hai, yani mani ko to kya hukm hai? Ye sun kar Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke Ae Umm Sulaim! Tu ne auraton ko ruswa kar diya, is wajah se ke ehtelam usi aurat ko ho ga jo bohat purshahwat ho aur mani bhi usi ki niklay gi. Tere haath mein mitti lagay, aur ye unhon ne naik baat kahi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Aisha! Tere haath mein mitti lagay aur Umm Sulaim se farmaya ke Ae Umm Sulaim! Jab aurat aisa dekhay to us soorat mein ghusl karay. (Muslim: 1/171). Baab: Janabat ke ghusl ki sifat."
"155","[AI-translation] Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye ghusl-e-janabat ke wastay pani rakha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne pehle do baar ya teen baar donon haath dhoye, phir haath bartan mein daala aur sharmgah par pani daal kar baayein haath se dhoya, phir baayein haath ko zameen par zor se ragar kar dhoya phir wuzu kiya jaisay namaz ke liye kartay thay, phir apne sar par teen challu bhar kar daalay, phir saaray badan ko dhoya, phir us jagah se hat kar aur paon dhoye. Phir main badan poochnay ko rumal, tauliya, le kar aayi to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne na liya. (Muslim: 1/175). Baab: Janabat ke ghusl mein pani ki miqdaar."
"156","[AI-translation] Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman, Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ke razai bhanjay, kehtay hain ke main aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ka razai bhai, Abdullah bin Yazid, un ke paas gaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghusl-e-janabat ke mutaliq poocha? Unhon ne aik bartan mangwaya jis mein sa' bhar pani aata tha aur hamaray aur apne darmiyan parday ki aar se ghusl kiya aur unhon ne apne sar par teen baar pani daala. Abu Salama ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyan apne baal katrati thin aur kaanon tak baal rakhti thin. Azwaaj-e-mutahharat ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki rehlat ke baad zeenat khatm karnay ke liye aisa kiya tha kyunke baal aurat ki zeenat hain. (Muslim: 1/176). Baab: Ghusl karnay walay ka kapray se pardah. (Abu Salama Aisha ke razai bhatijay hain, Umm Kulsoom bint Abu Bakr ne doodh pilaya; wafra se murad kaanon tak baal hain.)"
"157","[AI-translation] Umm Hani bint Abu Talib (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke jis saal Makka fatah hua, wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayein aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makka ke buland jaanib mein thay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghusl karnay ke liye uthay, to Fatima (raziyallahu anha) ne aik kapray ki aar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par ki, phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna kapra le kar lapaita aur phir aath rakatein chasht ki padhein. (Muslim: 1/183). (Muslim mein annahu hai.)"
"158","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Muhammad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Bani Israeel ke log nangay nahaya kartay aur aik doosray ke satr ko dekha kartay thay. Aur Musa (alaihissalam) akelay nahatay thay. Logon ne kaha ke Musa (alaihissalam) hamaray saath mil kar is liye nahi nahatay ke un ko to futq ki beemari hai, yani khusiye barh janay ki. Aik dafa Musa (alaihissalam) nahanay ko gaye aur kapray utaar kar aik pathar par rakhay, to pathar, khud bakhud Allah ke hukm se, un ke kapray lekar bhaag khara hua. Musa (alaihissalam) us ke peechay dauray aur kehtay jatay ke Ae pathar mere kapray de, Ae pathar mere kapray de! Yahan tak ke Bani Israeel ne un ka satr dekh liya aur kehnay lagay ke Allah ki qasam! Un ko to koi beemari nahi hai. Us waqt pathar khara ho gaya aur unhein khoob dekha gaya. Phir unhon ne apne kapray uthaye aur, ghussay se, pathar ko maarna shuru kiya. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke Allah ki qasam! Us pathar par Musa (alaihissalam) ki chhe ya saat maaron ka nishan hai. (Muslim). Baab: Mard ka mard ke satr ko aur aurat ka aurat ke satr ko na dekhna. (Udara se murad khusiye ka phoolna hai; jamaha se murad taiz daurna hai.)"
"159","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik mard doosray mard ke satr ko, yani wo hissa jis ka chhupana farz hai, na dekhay aur na aurat doosri aurat ke satr ko dekhay aur na mard doosray mard ke saath aik kapray mein laitay aur na aurat doosri aurat ke saath aik kapray mein laitay. (Muslim: 1/183). Baab: Pardah aur insaan nangay na dekha jaye. (Muslim mein saub wahid hai.)"
"160","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) logon ke saath tameer-e-Kaaba ke liye pathar dho rahay thay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tehband baandhay hue thay ke Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) jo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chacha thay, ne kaha ke Ae mere bhatijay! Tum apni azaar utaar kar kandhay par daal lo to acha hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne azaar khol kar kandhay par daal li to usi waqt ghash kha kar gir paray. Phir us din se Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko nanga nahi dekha gaya. (Muslim: 1/184). Baab: Mard aur aurat ka aik bartan se janabat ka ghusl."
"161","[AI-translation] Muaza se Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik hi bartan se ghusl kartay thay, jo mere aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darmiyan mein hota tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jaldi jaldi pani letay, yahan tak ke main kehti ke thora pani mere liye chhor do. Muaza rawi-e-hadees kehti hain: Aur donon janabat se hotay thay. (Muslim: 1/176)"
"162","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab junbi hotay aur khana ya sona chahtay to wuzu kar letay jaisay namaz ke liye kartay thay. (Muslim: 1/170). Baab: Ghusl se pehle junbi ka sona."
"163","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abu Qais se riwayat hai ke main ne Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke witr ke baaray mein poocha phir hadees, witr ke mutaliq, bayan ki. Main ne kaha Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) janabat mein kya kya kartay thay? Kya Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sonay se pehle ghusl kartay thay ya ghusl se pehle so jatay thay? Unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) donon tarah kartay thay, kabhi ghusl kar letay, phir sotay aur kabhi wuzu kar ke so rehtay. Main ne kaha ke Allah ka shukr hai jis ne is amr mein gunjaish rakhi. (Muslim: 1/171). Baab: Jo apni biwi ke paas aaye phir dobara chaahay to wuzu karay."
"164","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni aurat se sohbat karay, phir dobara sohbat karna chahay, to wuzu kar le, phir sohbat karay. (Muslim: 1/171). Baab: Tayammum aur us ke baaray mein."
"165","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath safar mein niklay, jab Baida ya Zaat-ul-Jaish mein pahunchay, Baida aur Zaat-ul-Jaish Khaibar aur Madina ke darmiyan maqam ke naam hain, to mere galay ka haar toot kar gir gaya aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke dhoondnay ke liye thehar gaye. Log bhi thehar gaye. Wahan pani na tha aur na logon ke paas pani tha. Log Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaye aur kehnay lagay ke tum dekhtay nahi ke Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kya kiya hai? Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko thehraya hai aur logon ko bhi, jahan pani nahi aur na un ke paas pani hai. Ye sun kar Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apna sar meri raan par rakhay so gaye thay. Unhon ne kaha ke tu ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko rok rakha hai aur logon ko jahan na pani hai aur na logon ke paas pani hai aur unhon ne ghussa kiya aur jo Allah ne chaha wo keh daala aur meri kokh mein haath se ghonsay maarnay lagay. Main zaroor hilti magar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka sar meri raan par tha, us wajah se main na hili. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sotay rahay yahan tak ke subah ho gayi aur pani bilkul na tha tab Allah Taala ne tayammum ki aayat utari to sab ne tayammum kiya. Usaid bin Huzair (raziyallahu anhu) jo naqeebon mein se thay, ne kaha ke Ae Abu Bakr ki aulad! Ye tumhari kuch pehli barkat nahi hai, yani tumhari wajah se Allah Taala ne hamesha Musalmanon ko faida diya hai, ye bhi aik nemat tumharay sabab se mili. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir ham ne us oont ko uthaya jis par main sawaar thi, to haar us ke neechay se mil gaya. (Muslim)"
"166","[AI-translation] Shaqiq kehtay hain ke main Abdullah bin Mas'ud aur Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas baitha hua tha. Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Abu Abdur Rahman, ye kuniyat hai Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ki, agar kisi shakhs ko janabat ho aur aik maheenay tak pani na milay to wo namaz ka kya karay? Abdullah ne kaha ke usay aik maheena tak bhi pani na milay to bhi tayammum na karay. Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir Surah Maida mein ye jo aayat hai ke pani na pao to paak mitti se tayammum karo, us ka kya hukm hai? Abdullah ne kaha ke agar is aayat se un ko janabat mein tayammum karnay ki ijazat di gayi to wo rafta rafta pani thanda honay ki soorat mein bhi tayammum karnay lag jayein ge. Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum ne Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees nahi suni ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe aik kaam ko bheja, wahan main junbi ho gaya aur pani na mila to main khaak mein is tarah se laita jaisay janwar lait-ta hai. Us ke baad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bayan kiya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tujhe donon haathon se is tarah karna kaafi tha. Phir Aap ne donon haath zameen par aik baar maaray aur baayein haath ko daahnay haath par maara. Phir hatheliyon ki pusht aur munh par masah kiya. Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum jantay ho ke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees par qanaat nahi ki. Ibn Mas'ud aur Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ka khayal tha ke janabat se tayammum kaafi nahi hai. Lekin ahadees se sabit hai ke unhon ne apne is mauqif se rujoo kar liya tha. (Muslim). Baab: Salam ka jawab tayammum se."
"167","[AI-translation] Umair maula Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main aur Abdur Rahman bin Yasar jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwi Maimuna (raziyallahu anha) ke maula thay Abul Jahm bin Haris ke paas gaye. Abul Jahm ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Bair-e-Jamal, Madina ke qareeb aik maqam hai, ki taraf se aaye, raah mein aik shakhs mila, us ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko salam kiya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jawab nahi diya yahan tak ke aik deewar ke paas aaye aur munh aur donon haathon par masah kiya aur phir salam ka jawab diya. (Muslim: 1/194). Baab: Momin najis nahi hota."
"168","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Madina ke aik rastay mein milay aur wo junbi thay, to khisak gaye aur ja kar ghusl kiya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein ghum paya, jab wo aaye to poocha ke kahan thay? Unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Jis waqt Aap mujh se milay main junbi tha, main ne ghusl kiye baghair Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas baithna na pasand kiya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya SubhanAllah! Momin kahin najis hota hai? (Muslim: 1/194). Baab: Har haal mein Allah ka zikr."
"169","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) har waqt har haal mein Allah ki yaad mein mashghool rehtay thay. (Muslim: 1/194). Baab: Be-wuzu ka khana."
"170","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bait-ul-khala se niklay aur khana laya gaya. Logon ne Aap ko wuzu yaad dilaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya main namaz padhnay laga hun jo wuzu karun? (Muslim: 1/195)"
